SUMMARY:Lemonade Stand Night
DESCRIPTION:Lavender lemonade is here and what better way to celebrate than with our adult lemonade stand! We will not only have lavender lemonade\, but adult lemonade cocktails and mocktails. Stop by and enjoy this blast from the past – one night only! Don’t worry\, you’re in the bull pen\, so grab one to go and enjoy your stroll around\, or head down to the live music on campus!
