DESCRIPTION:Learn about the rich history and cultural significance of this ancient art form. Hands-On Experience: Create your own designs and carve them onto lino rubber blocks or use the original wooden blocks to create your own cards or bookmarks. Handkerchief/scarf available for purchase! All Materials Provided: Blocks\, inks\, handmade paper\, fabric\, and other stationery will be supplied.
