SUMMARY:OUT On The Block
DESCRIPTION:Replacing PRIDE In The Park\, OUT On The Block is the second official event for the Pride: Durham\, NC Event Series (JUNE SATURDAYS) for National Pride Month. This event is a PRIDE block party/festival for kids\, youth\, and families of all ages\, with more activities for younger kids in the morning and more activities for teens in the afternoon. Come at 12PM for a kid-centered parade!
